# Manifold level 10
# The tower's first floor (stage 5b): a floor to prove the games' shell, not one of the tower's own (5d
# builds those by the gym's measures). Up a stair onto platforms a meter up, across a gap of 5 m (the
# far side 6 m deep), up two stairs to the goal 3 m up; a star on two platforms stacked 2 m high in the
# gap's side. Later in the evening, a lamp lit over the goal.
title The first floor
spawn 0 1 6
facing 0 0 -1
ambient 0.7
sky 19.25

kit floor_4  -4 0 6
kit floor_4  0 0 6
kit floor_4  4 0 6
kit floor_4  -4 0 2
kit floor_4  0 0 2
kit floor_4  4 0 2
kit floor_4  -4 0 -2
kit floor_4  0 0 -2
kit floor_4  4 0 -2
kit floor_4  -4 0 -6
kit floor_4  0 0 -6
kit floor_4  4 0 -6
kit floor_4  -4 0 -10
kit floor_4  0 0 -10
kit floor_4  4 0 -10
kit floor_4  -4 0 -14
kit floor_4  0 0 -14
kit floor_4  4 0 -14
kit floor_4  -4 0 -18
kit floor_4  0 0 -18
kit floor_4  4 0 -18
kit floor_4  -4 0 -22
kit floor_4  0 0 -22
kit floor_4  4 0 -22

kit stairs_1    0 0 0
kit platform_2  0 0 -2
kit platform_2  0 0 -4
kit platform_2  0 0 -11
kit platform_2  0 0 -13
kit platform_2  0 0 -15
